{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的大号白色标题首先入眼，随后下方紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"亲密相处越来越幸福，却开始担心这份关系不能一直持续，害怕对方有一天不再需要自己。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、患得患失、害怕失去，也有想靠近又怕受伤的矛盾感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"从最初害怕自己的需要给对方添负担，转变为如今更害怕不被需要；以及想收回心意却发现这样反而让自己更难受的具体心理过程。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大字号文字都很突出，存在一定的主视线竞争。\",\n    \"下方主段较长，具体处境和内心矛盾分布在多行，完整理解需要额外扫读。\",\n    \"紫色放大的问句虽然醒目，但单独看只能传达害怕受伤，不能直接说明关系处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "08a8f510-8cdf-4029-bf1d-cfce1be1abfe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012145223406Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:22:31.163913+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6885edd959207101ddc36c99955c51c653b8e0bd1ce08985983a561574d82a1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",